<title>USA: AAR signs agreement with Lufthansa.</title>
<headline>AAR signs agreement with Lufthansa.</headline>
<dateline>ELK GROVE VILLAGE, Ill. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>AAR Corp said Friday it signed a multi-year agreement with Lufthansa CityLine, a subsidiary of Deutsche Lufthansa AG, to overhaul and manage all airframe rotable parts for the airline's 18 AVRO RJ85 aircraft.</p>
<p>The value of the contract was not disclosed.</p>
<p>AAR has been supplying the airline with parts during the past year.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
